msgstr ""
"Cara memantau atau membatalkan job yang dikirimkan ke IBM Quantum Platform"

#. type: Yaml Front Matter Hash Value: sidebar_label
#, no-wrap
msgid "Monitor or cancel a job"
msgstr "Memantau atau membatalkan job"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<OpenInLabBanner notebookPath=\"guides/monitor-job.ipynb\" />\n"
msgstr "<OpenInLabBanner notebookPath=\"guides/monitor-job.ipynb\" />\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"View a list of your workloads on the [Workloads "
"page](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/workloads).\n"
msgstr ""
"Lihat daftar beban kerja kamu di [halaman "
"Workloads](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/workloads).\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "View job status {#view-job-status}"
msgstr "Lihat status job {#view-job-status}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Go to your [Workloads table](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/workloads) and "
"check under the Status column for whether a job has completed or failed.\n"
msgstr ""
"Buka [tabel Workloads](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/workloads) dan periksa "
"kolom Status untuk melihat apakah job sudah selesai atau gagal.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "View remaining usage {#view-remaining-usage}"
msgstr "Lihat sisa penggunaan {#view-remaining-usage}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Go to your [Instances table](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances) and "
"select the tab associated with the plan you want to view remaining usage "
"for. Total time used and total time remaining on your plan is displayed.\n"
msgstr ""
"Buka [tabel Instances](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/instances) dan pilih "
"tab yang sesuai dengan paket yang ingin kamu lihat sisa penggunaannya. Total"
" waktu yang sudah digunakan dan total waktu yang tersisa pada paket kamu "
"akan ditampilkan.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"View metrics on number of jobs and workloads submitted {#view-metrics-on-"
"number-of-jobs-and-workloads-submitted}"
msgstr ""
"Lihat metrik jumlah job dan workload yang dikirimkan {#view-metrics-on-"
"number-of-jobs-and-workloads-submitted}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Go to the [Analytics page](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/analytics) to see "
"the total number of jobs submitted, as well as a count of batch workloads "
"and session workloads. Note that you can only see the Analytics page for "
"accounts that you own or manage.\n"
msgstr ""
"Buka [halaman Analytics](https://quantum.cloud.ibm.com/analytics) untuk "
"melihat total jumlah job yang dikirimkan, serta jumlah batch workload dan "
"session workload. Perlu diingat bahwa kamu hanya bisa melihat halaman "
"Analytics untuk akun yang kamu miliki atau kelola.\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Monitor a job {#monitor-a-job}"
msgstr "Pantau job {#monitor-a-job}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Use the job instance to check the job status or retrieve the results by "
"calling the appropriate command:\n"
msgstr ""
"Gunakan instance job untuk memeriksa status job atau mengambil hasilnya "
"dengan memanggil perintah yang sesuai:\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"|                               |                                                                                                                                                                                                              |\n"
"| ----------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n"
"| job.result()                  | Review job results immediately after the job completes. Job results are available after the job completes. Therefore, job.result() is a blocking call until the job completes.                               |\n"
"| job.job\\_id()                 | Return the ID that uniquely identifies that job. Retrieving the job results at a later time requires the job ID. Therefore, it is recommended that you save the IDs of jobs you might want to retrieve later. |\n"
"| job.status()                  | Check the job status.                                                                                                                                                                                        |\n"
"| job = service.job(\\<job\\_id>) | Retrieve a job you previously submitted. This call requires the job ID.                                                                                                                                      |\n"
msgstr ""
"|                               |                                                                                                                                                                                                              |\n"
"| ----------------------------- | ------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------ |\n"
"| job.result()                  | Tinjau hasil job segera setelah job selesai. Hasil job tersedia setelah job selesai. Oleh karena itu, job.result() adalah panggilan pemblokiran sampai job selesai.                               |\n"
"| job.job\\_id()                 | Kembalikan ID yang secara unik mengidentifikasi job tersebut. Mengambil hasil job di lain waktu membutuhkan ID job. Oleh karena itu, disarankan untuk menyimpan ID job yang mungkin ingin kamu ambil nanti. |\n"
"| job.status()                  | Periksa status job.                                                                                                                                                                                        |\n"
"| job = service.job(\\<job\\_id>) | Ambil job yang sebelumnya kamu kirimkan. Panggilan ini membutuhkan ID job.                                                                                                                                      |\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "<span id=\"retrieve-later\"></span>\n"
msgstr "<span id=\"retrieve-later\"></span>\n"

#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Retrieve job results at a later time {#retrieve-job-results-at-a-later-time}"
msgstr "Ambil hasil job di lain waktu {#retrieve-job-results-at-a-later-time}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"Call `service.job(\\<job\\_id>)` to retrieve a job you previously submitted."
" If you don't have the job ID, or if you want to retrieve multiple jobs at "
"once; including jobs from retired QPUs (quantum processing units), call "
"`service.jobs()` with optional filters instead. See "
"[QiskitRuntimeService.jobs](../api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/qiskit-runtime-"
"service#jobs).\n"
msgstr ""
"Panggil `service.job(\\<job\\_id>)` untuk mengambil job yang sebelumnya kamu"
" kirimkan. Jika kamu tidak punya ID job, atau jika ingin mengambil beberapa "
"job sekaligus — termasuk job dari QPU (unit pemrosesan kuantum) yang sudah "
"pensiun — panggil `service.jobs()` dengan filter opsional. Lihat "
"[QiskitRuntimeService.jobs](../api/qiskit-ibm-runtime/qiskit-runtime-"
"service#jobs).\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Deprecated provider packages\">\n"
"  `service.jobs()` also returns jobs run from the deprecated `qiskit-ibm-provider` package. Jobs submitted by the older (also deprecated) `qiskit-ibmq-provider` package are no longer available.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"
msgstr ""
"<Admonition type=\"note\" title=\"Paket provider yang sudah tidak didukung\">\n"
"  `service.jobs()` juga mengembalikan job yang dijalankan dari paket `qiskit-ibm-provider` yang sudah tidak didukung. Job yang dikirimkan oleh paket yang lebih lama (juga sudah tidak didukung) `qiskit-ibmq-provider` tidak lagi tersedia.\n"
"</Admonition>\n"

