#. type: Title ##
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "Cancel a job {#cancel-a-job}"
msgstr "Batalkan job {#cancel-a-job}"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid ""
"You can cancel a job from the IBM Quantum Platform dashboard either on the "
"Workloads page or the details page for a specific workload. On the Workloads"
" page, click the overflow menu at the end of the row for that workload, and "
"select Cancel. If you are on the details page for a specific workload, use "
"the Actions dropdown at the top of the page, and select Cancel.\n"
msgstr ""
"Kamu bisa membatalkan job dari dasbor IBM Quantum Platform baik di halaman "
"Workloads maupun halaman detail untuk workload tertentu. Di halaman "
"Workloads, klik menu overflow di akhir baris workload tersebut, lalu pilih "
"Cancel. Jika kamu berada di halaman detail untuk workload tertentu, gunakan "
"dropdown Actions di bagian atas halaman, lalu pilih Cancel.\n"

#. type: Plain text
#, markdown-text, no-wrap
msgid "In Qiskit, use `job.cancel()` to cancel a job.\n"
msgstr "Di Qiskit, gunakan `job.cancel()` untuk membatalkan job.\n"

